WEBVTT

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.250
You want to know who the strongest 
man in the Kabuki District is?

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:01.760
You must be new in town.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.050
You won't last long with that attitude.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:06.270
Forget it.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.760
This town is on a whole different level.

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:11.450
You got thugs, brawlers, 
vigilantes, and rogue warriors

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:13.160
from all over Edo here.

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:15.270
It's like a haven for hooligans.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:16.650
This is for your own good.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.440
Have a drink and go back 
to the countryside.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.520
What's that?

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:25.230
You want me to tell you about 
the top dogs before you go?

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.530
You really like this stuff.

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:30.030
First, there are four monsters 
on a level of their own.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.790
The Fierce and Divine 
Mademoiselle Saigo.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.120
Jirocho Doromizu the Gallant.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.290
Peacock Princess Kada.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.540
Empress Otose.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.540
The four factions are in a

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.120
standoff which preserves a 
fragile balance of power.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.210
Who would be the strongest in a fight?

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.920
You wouldn't be able to 
even scratch those beasts.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:53.080
Saigo and Jirocho, in particular, 
were heroes during the Joi War.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.310
Well, they're too old 
to go on a tear now.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.310
If you want someone 
who's currently active,

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.590
there's Katsuo Kurogoma,

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:02.440
a young leader in the Doromizu faction.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.690
He's the most feared man 
in the Kabuki District now.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.520
You'll also find a few former 
Joi in Saigo's faction.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:10.930
There are rumors about

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:13.470
Kada's faction having 
ties to some crazy folk.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.290
Otose's faction?

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:20.620
<b>Snack Otose</b>

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.620
It's just a bar, really.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.430
She's just an old lady 
with a soft heart.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:28.500
But if you try any funny 
business on her turf,

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.050
you'll run into a certain guy.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.730
A guy who holds his own against 
the Big Three by himself.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.560
One hell of a monster,

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.930
with hair that's completely white.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:46.730
A demon...

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.370
That's too bad.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.610
I was going to decorate your

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.240
completely white head with 
some bright red flowers.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.340
Your reputation precedes you.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.750
The strongest man in 
the Kabuki District...

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.370
Gintoki Sakata-san...

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:06.160
Who are you...?

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.510
I didn't realize how 
strong you were, Bro!

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.100
Could you take me in...

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.390
...as one of your underlings?

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:21.390
<b>A Lawless Town Tends to Attract 
a Bunch of Whoohooey Folk</b>

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:23.390
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan</b>

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.830
It's freezing.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.190
It's always so cold in the morning.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.400
Who is she?

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.280
A drunk?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:34.230
Uh, excuse me.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.280
You'll catch a cold if you sleep here.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:37.780
Excuse me.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.160
Your snot has frozen.

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.540
Yikes, it's a raid!

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.630
Wha-Wha-Wha--

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.070
What are you doing?!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:47.960
Which gang are you from?

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.630
If you try to lay a finger on my Bro,

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.660
I'll make some bright red flowers.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.640
What are you babbling about?!

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.700
Wait a moment here!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.390
Wait!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.020
It's too early for all this noise.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:04.520
<b>Snack Otose</b>

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:09.400
I am the newest member of the 
Odd Jobs gang, Pirako Chin.

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:13.400
It is an honor to meet 
the big boss Otose.

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.600
I apologize for my behavior earlier.

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:19.030
I didn't realize that you were 
the Bro's number one underling.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:22.290
I'll make up for it by 
cutting off my pinky.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.540
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:27.950
I have nothing to do 
with organized crime.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:29.680
And I don't want any underlings.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.220
And I told you to get lost already!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.250
You damn punk girl!

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:33.950
You're tearing out my hair!

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.330
The two of us can become the bosses

00:05:36.330 --> 00:05:38.370
of the underworld, Bro!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.510
When did I ever say that I 
wanted to be Darth Vader!

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.980
What's with her?

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:44.370
Please! I have nowhere else to go!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.050
You come from a gang?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:48.940
I've heard rumors.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.970
The Uekibachi gang was having a

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:52.860
business quarrel with Jirocho's people.

00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:56.540
When a fight broke out, 
there was a crazy girl who

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.010
took out the whole lot by herself.

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:01.460
Her name was Pirako the killer.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.360
Huh?! A killer?!

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.690
This little twit?!

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.870
This little girl works 
for the underworld?!

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.780
It's nothing to brag about.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:13.380
I just happen to be good 
at decorating with flowers.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.110
Did you know?

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.450
The more evil someone is,

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.140
the more beautiful a flower they make.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:21.890
And when I cut them up more, the 
flowers are redder and prettier!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:23.720
Uh, I'm very sorry.

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.420
I didn't mean to call you a little girl.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.480
You said you have nowhere to go?

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:28.490
What happened to your former employers?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:29.900
They're dead.

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.540
They were jumped by the Jirocho gang

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.650
and turned into a lovely garden.

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:36.990
There was a nice man 
there who took me in,

00:06:36.990 --> 00:06:38.540
and I always did what I was told,

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.750
so I don't know what to do now.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:44.160
But I only know how to 
decorate with flowers.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.580
That's why I'm here.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.910
I'm here to turn the 
town where Jirocho is...

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:53.290
To turn the Kabuki District into a
garden of bright red flower garden!

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.530
Hey, hey, hey!

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:57.920
The Bro is passin' through!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:01.430
Whatcha lookin' at, twerps? Eh?!

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.470
You wanna make something of it?!

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:05.180
Wanna make something of it?!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:06.980
This is bad. Very bad.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:08.680
We've picked up a really dangerous girl.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.910
She said she's going to turn the 
Kabuki District into a flower garden.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.710
She means a sea of blood, doesn't she?

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:16.440
She wants to use your strength 
to get revenge on Jirocho.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:18.510
I-It'll be okay.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:20.450
<b>Hey! Wanna fight?</b>

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:20.950
She's a killer, but she's just a girl.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.800
She can't be stupid enough 
to take on the big boss...

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.720
Look here, Bro!

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:27.260
Pretty flowers!

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:27.990
See?

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.790
She looks like a perfectly normal girl

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:30.960
who happens to like flowers...

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.700
Gran, you been payin' all your fees?

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:34.460
Eh?!

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:37.790
Don't make threats with 
a smile on your face!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.120
A gang needs money to run.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.430
In return, we provide security.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.390
They're looking for security from us!

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:47.730
Now listen to me.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.620
If you want to join Odd Jobs,

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.640
forget all that dark side stuff.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.520
You aren't Darth Vader.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:55.150
You're just an ordinary girl.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.590
You aren't Pirako Chin.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.240
From now on, you're Birako Man.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.400
What kind of name is that?!

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:01.720
Understood.

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:03.010
I'm Birabirako Man.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.130
No, you have an extra "bira" in there!

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.080
Could you stop that?!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:07.720
Hey, there's a cute 
cake place over there!

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:12.060
You can learn how to be a girl 
there, Birabirabirabirako Man!

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.670
Enough with the "birabira" already!

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:15.920
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.340
I've never been in a 
place like this before.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:19.670
Do I stand out?

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:21.270
Not at all.

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.100
You look perfectly natural here!

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.180
You guys stand out like sore thumbs.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.270
Don't worry about it, 
Birabirabirabirako-san.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.410
You look like a very normal...

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:32.430
No, a very cute girl.

00:08:32.430 --> 00:08:32.940
Huh?

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:35.190
You should drop the gangster act.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.000
It's such a waste.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.440
Oh, sorry about trying 
to boss you around.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:41.120
Come on, what are you doing?

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.190
Eat your cake.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:45.080
If you don't eat your cake, I'll eat it.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.840
A cockroach was chewing on my cake.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.090
It's too dirty for me to eat.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.290
What are you going to 
do about this, dammit?

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.740
Hey! Are you saying I'm a cockroach?!

00:08:57.740 --> 00:08:59.860
I'm actually kind of a clean freak.

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.630
Gangster stuff aside.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:02.920
Gangster stuff aside?!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:12.640
<b>Morimioto Candy</b>

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:05.080
So you just hate me, period?!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.460
No sweat. That wasn't your fault.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.170
Nothing wrong there.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:08.710
That's how a normal girl would react.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.060
Why are you defending her?!

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.640
Don't make it sound like every 
single girl is anti-Shinpachi!

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.520
If you act gangster again,
 you get another "bira" tacked on.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.630
At least your name will feel more girly,

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:20.480
Birabirabirabirabirako Man.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:21.950
How is that name girly?!

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.870
It makes her sound like 
a "birabira" monster!

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.240
Enough already!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:28.570
Hey, there's a cute 
dried fish place, *****!

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:29.660
Watch your mouth!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:31.660
Whoa, look at this, Birako Man!

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:33.950
They're all dried! They're all hard!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.570
And wait, you're just taking

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:36.080
<b>Ooh, it's so cute!</b>

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:37.290
her to the places you want to go!

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.250
<b>Why is it so dry?</b>

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.670
What's so girly about dried fish?!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.380
Bro!

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:42.880
Oh, sorry...

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:47.380
Bro! What's wrong?!

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:47.400
It's broken!

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.680
The impact broke it!

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:52.060
Here comes the real thing!

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.140
This is bad.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.140
<b>Hey, girl!</b>

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:54.200
We were making progress,

00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:56.390
<b>Whatcha gonna do about this?</b>

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:56.380
but they're going to stimulate 
her gangster blood.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.940
<b>Gran, give me some sukonbu.</b>

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.890
If they're from Jirocho's faction...

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.980
Bah, can't help it.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.280
Gin-san! No violence!

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.490
I know.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.950
I'll settle this in a mature 
and gentlemanly fashion.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:12.330
Excuse me, did my friend 
do something wrong?

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.080
Huh? Who are you?

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.280
B-Bro!

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:17.480
What's wrong?

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.090
I-It's broken...

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:22.880
Th-The pat on the shoulder 
shattered all of my bones!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.420
You're doing the exact same thing!

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.670
What do you mean, pat on the shoulder?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.570
You're the one who patted 
me on the shoulder!

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:32.400
So, what are you going to do about this?

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.220
Hey!

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.770
You're making it worse!

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:37.020
That won't do! Calm down, Birako!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.600
Here's your change.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.610
Why are you pretending 
to break your bones?!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.230
Uh, you broke your arm,

00:10:44.230 --> 00:10:46.550
while two of us broke all of our bones.

00:10:46.550 --> 00:10:48.220
Can we call it even?

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:50.710
You broke your own bones!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.450
That girl wasn't anywhere near us!

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:55.560
Bro, that's enough.

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:57.960
He's the one who's with Otose...

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:58.620
What?

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:00.340
Oh...

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.340
He's the one who took 
on Big Bro Katsuo...

00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:04.750
Katsuo Kurogoma...

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:06.340
So they belong to Jirocho's gang.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:09.670
All of my bones have been broken...

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.280
Could you let this one slide?

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:12.680
B-Bro, we should go...

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.060
I'll let you go today.

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:17.460
Now come with me.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.140
Huh?

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.890
I don't have any business with him,

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:22.770
but I'll need you to pay up

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:24.650
by using that body of yours...

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.190
N-No! Bro!

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.320
Please wait a moment!

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.900
Stop struggling!

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.110
You damn bitch!

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:34.730
Huh?

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.950
I thought your bones were all broken?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.130
And your arm?

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:40.960
It seems to be in...

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.460
...terrible shape!

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:48.610
N-Now he's done it!

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.880
<b>Matsuo to Kiyoshi</b>

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:50.880
Bro!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:53.090
Snap out of it, Bro!

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:54.850
Wha-Wha--

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:54.850
<b>Bro!</b>

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.510
<b>Wake up, Bro!</b>

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.020
What the hell are you doing?!

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:59.380
Why did you make the first move?!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:03.050
Well, he was taking advantage 
of my gracious behavior.

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:04.450
I just gave him a little flick.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.210
The hell you did!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.610
You sent him flying through the air!

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:08.100
You rule, Bro!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:09.550
I think I'm in love.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:13.370
Now we have no choice but to 
fight it out with Jirocho.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.690
Together, we can make 
lots of red flowers

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:18.450
and become the bosses of Japan.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.530
Damn it!

00:12:20.530 --> 00:12:22.080
You tricked me!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:23.300
<b>Bastards!</b>

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.080
That's not funny!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.580
<b>You won't get away with this!</b>

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:26.090
I'm not gonna pick a fight with Jirocho!

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:26.770
<b>This means war!</b>

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:28.280
I ain't gonna fight a war!

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:30.840
Gin-san! You're starting 
the war as we speak!

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:32.280
Pipe down!

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:33.280
Calm yourself!

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:35.480
Calm yourself and look 
around for Dryaemon.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.350
You need to calm down!

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:38.730
It's okay, Ginta-kun!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:39.850
I have just what you need!

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:42.030
Ready-mix concrete!

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.640
What are you going to do with that?!

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:44.030
Shut up!

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:55.280
<b>Matsuo to Kiyoshi</b>

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.870
If we stick Giannosuke 
and Suneorochimaru

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.690
in here and toss it in the ocean,

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:50.620
we can basically shut them up forever!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.750
Lady Shizuka will be yours!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:53.610
Hell no!

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:55.280
You'll scare off Lady Shizuka!

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:59.400
Pops, give me the usual dog food...

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:02.660
Looks like a fight's going down.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:04.040
What's...

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:11.170
<b>Kabuki District Council
Meeting Room</b>

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:11.170
We will now begin the Ka-Kabuki 
District Council Meeting.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:17.180
<b>Kabuki District
Clean Up Project</b>

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:15.130
The topic today is separating trash...

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.930
Get lost, trash.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:19.910
Yes!

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.310
Excuse me!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.640
So what's this about?

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:32.820
<b>The Kabuki District's Empress Otose</b>

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.460
Why did you call us here?

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.820
I don't recall ever failing 
to separate my trash.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.440
You just did.

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:37.120
Why is this stinkin' garbage of a hag

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:41.660
<b>The Fierce and Divine Mademoiselle Saigo</b>

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.640
mixed in with us beauties?

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:41.660
You shouldn't be talking.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:47.670
<b>Peacock Princess Kada</b>

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:45.310
I'm glad to see that 
you haven't changed.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.670
I apologize for taking up your time.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.550
But you'll have to wait a little longer.

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:51.380
We're missing a member.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.670
Jirocho?

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:53.730
There's no point.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.880
It's been two or three years 
since he was last seen in public.

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:01.590
I was hoping to have all four 
Devas present for this discussion.

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:05.140
I called you here for one reason.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:07.840
You are probably aware that

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:11.150
the town has grown tense 
the past few years.

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.800
If nothing is done, 
a war will break out.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:18.200
I'm sure that nobody wishes 
for that to happen.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.830
Listen to yourself.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.490
You and Jirocho are the 
ones making a splash.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.340
It used to be that the casinos

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.610
in this town were run by Jirocho's gang.

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:30.830
But then you built a casino here.

00:14:31.110 --> 00:14:33.930
The same could be said of you, Saigo.

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:35.960
I've heard tales

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:39.640
that you're sheltering Joi 
patriots and rogue warriors.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:40.220
Huh?

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:42.870
Your soldiers may be dressed oddly,

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:45.780
but each one of them is quite strong.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.310
You plan on using their strength

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.730
to create an empire of trannies...

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.710
What are you talking about?

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:54.230
I'm offering a home to those 
who have no place to go.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:57.820
But the fact remains that 
you've repeatedly refused

00:14:57.820 --> 00:15:01.240
to accept the demands of Jirocho's gang.

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.360
And Otose...

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.970
I have no interest in your stupid fight,

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.830
and I'll have none of it.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:09.150
You may have no interest,

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:12.330
but you've always held great 
influence in this town.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.420
I've heard that you listen to the

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:17.340
problems of your customers 
and offer counseling.

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:21.220
And your pawns in that 
sketchy Odd Jobs group

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:23.560
provide the necessary assistance.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.850
They've been running wild 
across our territory.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:31.980
I never knew that I had 
pawns I could order around.

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:34.900
And I never knew that this town

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.370
had been divided up into territories.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.940
This town doesn't belong to anyone.

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:46.370
We just live our lives here.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.510
That's all.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.790
However, some are not satisfied by that.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.610
These days, we are 
known as the Four Devas

00:15:55.610 --> 00:15:58.550
who work together to run this town,

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:02.560
but didn't it all begin with the

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.930
rise of a new faction, 
a king of hooligans?

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:09.200
There is no reason for us to fight.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.120
After all,

00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:13.690
isn't our enemy Jirocho?

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:15.690
I see how it is.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:18.120
The three of you are teaming up

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.690
to get rid of Jirocho, the obstacle.

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:22.530
Well, well.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.530
Wait up!

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:26.910
It's over! This is war!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.460
This is all-out war!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.160
Gin-san!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:31.020
This is out of control!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.040
Ginta-kun is off on a 
rendezvous with Lady Shizuka.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:34.960
Huh?!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.580
The bastard used us as decoys!

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.270
I'll get you for this!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.970
It looks like they're gone, Bro.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:53.230
Things are getting fun.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:55.570
What's so fun about this?

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.970
Time to bust out an old cliche.

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:02.240
Revenge isn't fun for anyone.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:04.370
I'm sure that your dead friends

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.750
would want you to live 
like an ordinary girl

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:11.170
instead of letting revenge 
take over your life.

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:13.000
Bro...

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:17.550
Why do you keep talking about revenge?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:21.550
Uh, wasn't your gang 
slaughtered by Jirocho?

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:23.260
So you want revenge...

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:25.060
What are you talking about?

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:27.920
My gang was crushed by Jirocho,

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.260
but they're all alive.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.560
Huh?

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.020
But you said they were 
turned into a flower garden.

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:35.570
They quit the business 
to become farmers.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:36.520
They've planted a garden of red flowers.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.680
It's a pretty place.

00:17:38.680 --> 00:17:42.530
But it was boring, so I left.

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:43.750
Huh?!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.160
Could you be any more misleading?!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.490
We've been trying to subtly convince you

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:53.900
to give up on revenge because 
of your dark past...

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:54.960
So wait?

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.290
Why are you here?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.380
Like I said,

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:03.170
I'm here to decorate Jirocho 
and this town in red flowers.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.020
Enough of that.

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.300
Give it to me straight.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.050
I mean exactly what I say.

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:12.060
I'm here to help the great 
Jirocho bloom again.

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.370
For that,

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:16.210
I need the help of the strongest 
man in the Kabuki District!

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.970
That's you, Bro!

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.120
Got it.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:22.700
In other words, your 
mind is full of flowers,

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.940
and it's a waste of time 
to bother talking with you.

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.030
In that case, this is farewell...

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:40.650
Bro, the bond between gang 
members isn't easily broken.

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:43.340
I don't have a bond with 
a plastic trash can!

00:18:43.650 --> 00:18:45.430
The concrete's hard now!

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:48.340
This is all because you kept on talking!

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:49.360
What do we do?!

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:50.850
What's going to happen?!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.850
Well, that's easy enough.

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:55.600
You get served the treatment

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.980
you were gonna deal.

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:02.360
Y-You're...

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.030
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.530
The obstacle's here.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.280
Jirocho...

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:11.950
Don't mind me.

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:13.780
Carry on.

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:18.160
I believe the three of you were talking 
about teaming up to get rid of me?

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:21.280
We never said anything about that.

00:19:21.280 --> 00:19:24.170
I simply mentioned that our wish 
to avoid any pointless conflict

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:28.170
was being ruined by an 
unstoppable loose cannon.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.650
I would take him out.

00:19:30.650 --> 00:19:34.680
Some fools in this world 
can only be cured by death.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:38.430
But I wouldn't arrange 
a meeting like this.

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:39.560
Look.

00:19:39.560 --> 00:19:44.060
Your necks are all lined up 
within range of my blade.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.290
One of the Peacock Princess's pets, huh?

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.110
Stand down.

00:19:50.110 --> 00:19:51.240
He's merely joking.

00:19:51.510 --> 00:19:54.710
No, he made the correct decision.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:59.580
This pet was trained well to 
be able to detect my hostility.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:03.330
Unfortunately, I'm getting old,

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:06.600
so I have trouble controlling 
my piss and my hostility.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.840
I already sheathed my blade, 
but it keeps trickling out...

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:12.160
Case in point.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:16.370
You didn't notice me taking you out.

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:21.440
I said to stop this!

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:23.520
What do you think you're 
doing to the boss?!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.330
Take them!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:26.040
You've shown your true colors!

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:27.900
We won't let you lay a finger on Mama!

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:36.830
You were eavesdropping on a 
conversation between ladies?

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:41.210
You bastards ready to have 
your balls ripped out?!

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.040
Stand down, boys.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:43.940
Boss!

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:50.460
Ordinary humans have no place here.

00:20:52.870 --> 00:20:53.970
Good grief.

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:57.810
How do you intend to 
stop these monsters?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:21:00.980
If you have any ideas, 
I'd love to hear them.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:06.510
As you saw, power can only 
be restrained by more power.

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.480
Here is my proposal.

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:11.680
The factions of the Four Devas are

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:14.410
not allowed to engage 
in personal fights.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:19.940
The faction which breaks this rule

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:22.890
will be crushed by the other three.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.960
So in the end, it'll still be the three

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:29.630
of you teaming up against me?

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:35.680
You think you can take 
my balls by teaming up?

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:37.560
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.180
This rule is to prevent 
further conflict.

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:44.690
The town will be a dull 
place if nobody can fight.

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:49.440
If that's the only way to 
avoid a war, then so be it.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.820
Are you sane?

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.620
Very well.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.720
It'll be a test of endurance.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:03.270
Try not to screw up before I do.

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:05.960
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:41.720
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:36.630
Their past is revealed...

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:40.800
A battle pitting Gintoki 
against Jirocho...

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:44.970
<b>Ghosts Aren't the Only Ones 
Who Run Wild Around Graveyards</b>
